  "whatsapp_greeting": "\ud83d\udc4b Welcome to Localli Egypt! I'm your smart local guide for Sharm El Sheikh, Hurghada, Luxor, and Aswan.\n\nI can help you find:\n\ud83c\udf7d\ufe0f Restaurants & Cafes\n\ud83d\udc8a Pharmacies & Hospitals\n\ud83d\uded2 Supermarkets\n\ud83d\ude97 Shared Rides between cities\n\ud83d\udcb0 Fair prices & currency rates\n\ud83d\udd12 Safety info & live city status\n\ud83d\udd27 Home repair & housekeeping\n\nWhat do you need? Just ask! \ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddec\n\nSupported languages: English \u00b7 \u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u00b7 Deutsch \u00b7 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629",
